  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "A long-standing racist trope that dehumanizes Black people by likening them to animals, particularly apes or monkeys. This stereotype is directly invoked in the meme by depicting a lion (a big cat, often associated with primates in racist caricatures) being cared for by a 'master', implying enslaved Africans were treated as animals.",
